<view class="ew-page ew-screen" style="font-size:{{fontBase * fontScale}}px">
  <text class="ew-heading">饮食回顾</text>
  <text class="ew-subtitle">饮食统计只计入实际吃过的记录；计划执行单独对照。</text>
  <view class="ew-tabs">
    <view class="ew-hit-target ew-pill {{periodMode === 'week' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="week" bindtap="onMode">按周</view>
    <view class="ew-hit-target ew-pill {{periodMode === 'month' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="month" bindtap="onMode">按月</view>
  </view>
  <view class="ew-row ew-between period">
    <button class="ew-hit-target period-nav" bindtap="onPrevMonth" aria-label="上一周期"><ui-icon name="arrow-left" tone="muted" size="20" /></button>
    <text>{{rangeLabel}}</text>
    <button class="ew-hit-target period-nav" bindtap="onNextMonth" aria-label="下一周期"><ui-icon class="rotate-right" name="arrow-left" tone="muted" size="20" /></button>
  </view>
  <ui-state wx:if="{{loading}}" kind="loading" title="正在整理实际记录" />
  <ui-state wx:elif="{{errorMessage}}" kind="error" title="暂时无法读取回顾" description="{{errorMessage}}" action-label="重新加载" bind:action="loadStatistics" />
  <block wx:elif="{{reportView}}">
    <view class="ew-notice">{{report.description}} 每次打开都会重新读取；当前报告未存档。</view>
    <view data-report-block="overview">
      <text class="ew-section-title">用餐概览</text>
      <view class="ew-grid metrics">
        <view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{reportView.overview.mealCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">明确吃过的餐次</text></view>
        <view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{reportView.overview.recordedDays}}</text><text class="metric-label">有实际用餐的天数</text></view>
        <view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{reportView.overview.uniqueDishCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">已识别菜品种类</text></view>
        <view class="ew-card"><text class="ew-number">{{reportView.overview.entryCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">实际菜品条目</text></view>
      </view>
      <ui-state wx:if="{{reportView.overview.mealCount === 0}}" kind="empty" title="这一周期还没有实际用餐记录" description="计划不会自动当成吃过；没有记录也不等于没有吃饭。" action-label="记录饮食" bind:action="onRecord" />
      <view class="ew-card">
        <text class="ew-section-title">实际记录分布</text>
        <view class="ew-hit-target bar-row" wx:for="{{dailyRows}}" wx:key="date" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="onRecord">
          <text>{{item.label}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.width}}%"></view></view><text>{{item.count}} 餐</text>
        </view>
        <text class="ew-muted">条长相对本周期最多记录的一天，仅用于比较次数，不是记录完成率。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="ew-card" data-report-block="actualDetails">
      <text class="ew-section-title">实际用餐明细</text>
      <text wx:if="{{!recordRows.length}}" class="ew-muted">暂无明确吃过的菜品明细。</text>
      <view class="ew-hit-target record" wx:for="{{recordRows}}" wx:key="key" data-date="{{item.mealDate}}" data-meal="{{item.mealType}}" bindtap="onRecord">
        <text>{{item.mealDate}} · {{item.label}}</text><text class="ew-muted">{{item.names}}</text><text class="ew-link">查看 / 纠正这一餐 ›</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="ew-card" data-report-block="frequentDishes">
      <text class="ew-section-title">常吃与重复菜品</text>
      <view class="ew-row ew-between ranking" wx:for="{{reportView.frequentDishes.dishes}}" wx:key="dishId"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="ew-muted">{{item.count}} 餐出现</text></view>
      <text wx:if="{{!reportView.frequentDishes.dishes.length}}" class="ew-muted">暂无已识别的菜品。自由填写内容仍保留在实际用餐明细中。</text>
      <text class="ew-muted">按已知菜品 ID 统计；同一道菜在同一餐出现多次只计一餐，不根据菜名猜测身份。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="ew-card" data-report-block="categoryCounts">
      <text class="ew-section-title">菜品类别次数</text>
      <view class="bar-row" wx:for="{{categoryRows}}" wx:key="key"><text>{{item.label}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"></view></view><text>{{item.count}} 次</text></view>
      <text class="ew-muted">{{reportView.categoryCounts.classifiedCount}} / {{reportView.categoryCounts.entryCount}} 条实际菜品可识别类别。次数包含未分类条目，不代表营养摄入比例。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="ew-card" data-report-block="planExecution">
      <text class="ew-section-title">计划执行对照</text>
      <text class="ew-muted">仅对照安排是否执行，不计入饮食统计。</text>
      <text class="ew-muted">在所选周期内，截至 {{reportView.metadata.executionAsOfDate}}（{{reportView.metadata.timezone}}）：已到期安排 {{reportView.planExecution.plannedMealsDue}} 餐，按计划确认 {{reportView.planExecution.plannedMealsFollowed}} 餐，实际调整 {{reportView.planExecution.plannedMealsChanged}} 餐，明确取消 {{reportView.planExecution.skippedMeals}} 餐，未确认 {{reportView.planExecution.unconfirmedMeals}} 餐。未确认不等于没吃；今天与未来的计划不在到期统计内。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="ew-card" data-report-block="completeness">
      <text class="ew-section-title">记录完整性与缺失</text>
      <view class="record"><text>所选周期截至今天共 {{reportView.completeness.observedDays}} 天，其中 {{reportView.completeness.daysWithoutActualRecord}} 天没有任何实际记录行。</text><text class="ew-muted">记录行包含吃过、明确取消或撤销为未记录的状态。缺失天数不能推断是否用餐。</text></view>
      <view class="record"><text>明确取消 {{reportView.completeness.explicitSkippedMeals}} 餐；明确标记未记录 {{reportView.completeness.explicitUnrecordedMeals}} 餐。</text><text>自由填写菜品 {{reportView.completeness.freeTextEntryCount}} 条；未分类 {{reportView.completeness.unclassifiedCount}} 条；已吃但菜品明细缺失 {{reportView.completeness.actualMealsWithoutDishes}} 餐。</text></view>
      <text class="ew-muted">没有可靠的实际食用份量，暂不计算热量、营养分数或每日用餐完成率。</text>
      <button class="ew-hit-target ew-link" bindtap="onToggleProvenance">{{showProvenance ? '收起计算依据' : '查看计算依据'}}</button><view wx:if="{{showProvenance}}" class="record report-provenance"><text>报告编号：{{reportView.metadata.reportId}}</text><text>计算版本：{{reportView.metadata.calculationVersion}}</text><text>生成时间：{{reportView.metadata.generatedAt}}</text><text>日期时区：{{reportView.metadata.timezone}}</text><text selectable="{{true}}">来源指纹：{{reportView.metadata.sourceFingerprint}}</text><text class="ew-muted">这是当前记录的即时回顾。更正来源记录会重新计算；相同编号不代表已保存历史报告。</text></view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
